  * @param  __FSWP__ Within the following range: from 100 Kbit/s up to 2Mbit/s (in bit/s)
  * @param  __FSWPCLK__ PCLK or HSI frequency (in Hz)
  * @retval Bitrate prescaler (BRR register)
